# SHUTTERBUG: A takes a photo centred a third of the screen ahead of the
# ship, only with the camera's meter full; the meter then refills by itself
# in 22 seconds. A foe in the frame is stunned: it stops still, takes
# double damage, and is worth double. A foe outside the frame is not.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat pos 60 84
# a big comet right in the frame (60 + 107), and one off to the side
cheat dummy 10 167 84 0
cheat dummy 10 120 30 0
expect flash == 1320
press A
expect photos == 1
expect flash < 10
expect stunned == 1
expect stun_10 > 250
# the meter must be full: another tap does nothing
press A
expect photos == 1
wait 1280
expect flash < 1320
wait 40
expect flash == 1320
# double damage: two gun shots take four
cheat clear
cheat dummy 10 167 84 0
press A
expect stunned == 1
expect hp_10 == 10
hold B 7
wait 25
expect hp_10 == 8
# and double points when it falls (a big comet is worth 300)
expect score == 0
hold B
waituntil foes_10 == 0 80
expect score == 600
release B
# photographed, it doesn't break up
expect foes_11 == 0
# shot down without a photo, a big comet breaks into three little ones
cheat clear
cheat dummy 10 167 84 0
hold B
waituntil foes_10 == 0 100
release B
expect foes_11 == 3
expect score == 900
